WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Hollow Sound (1-02)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Neon Hearts (1989)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.200
[Atmospheric Synth-Pop Intro]

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.000
The red light's on

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.200
The tape is rolling

00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:00.800
They're telling me what words to say

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.600
I'm trying to find the man I was

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:14.400
But he gets farther every day

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:31.900
[Synth Instrumental Interlude]

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.800
They want the polish

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.800
They want the gleam

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.400
The "safer" version of the dream

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:55.000
But all I hear is a thin machine

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:01.800
Another part of their big scene

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.800
It's just a hollow sound

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.800
My voice is in the mix

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:17.800
But the words are not my own

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.400
It's just a hollow sound

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.500
Another plastic fix

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:32.000
I'm singing all alone

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:49.300
[Synth Instrumental Break]

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:56.800
They're all afraid of the burning cross

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:04.200
Terrified of what they lost

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:12.000
So now they're sanding off the edge

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:19.400
Pushing me back from the ledge

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:24.200
It's just a hollow sound

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:28.300
My voice is in the mix

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:35.200
But the words are not my own

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.800
It's just a hollow sound

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.900
Another plastic fix

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:49.000
I'm singing all alone

00:03:49.200 --> 00:04:37.000
[Clean, Melodic, Studio-Approved Keyboard Solo]

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:42.000
A hollow sound...

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:50.200
Just a hollow sound...

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.200
It's just a hollow sound

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.200
My voice is in the mix

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:08.000
But the words are not my own

